WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Little girl

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,280
Our family really can't survive anymore

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,160
No food or firewood

4
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:09,400
Please give us some supplies. I have a lot of family members and don’t have any extra. You can go find someone else.

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,790
So many relief supplies were distributed before

6
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:12,900
I let you all go away

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,210
Then we already have it

8
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,410
When you moved to the resettlement camp

9
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,770
They didn't send you supplies over there.

10
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,050
Get one copy from the resettlement camp

11
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,290
I want to get another one when I come back.

12
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,370
Anyway, we have nothing now and you won’t give us anything.

13
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:24,530
I will die in front of your house today casually

14
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:25,810
You'd rather freeze to death here

15
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,250
I clean up one corpse at most

16
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,800
She is an old lady

17
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,480
It’s hard to climb the fifteenth floor by yourself

18
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:44,180
There's probably someone else behind you

19
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,580
There just was an old lady at my door

20
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,620
Throwing drug supplies

21
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,250
Have you gone to your place?

22
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,170
Don't open the door for her

23
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:51,690
It's too much for anyone to care about themselves now.

24
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,970
I know where there are extra supplies for others.

25
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,330
Just to remind you
